        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Pouora, Ng\u0101 Purapura\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - CLOSED\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n  <h4>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           1.0 FTE Permanent, Full time\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h4>\r\n  <h4>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u014ctaki\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n  <img src=\"https://irp.cdn-website.com/002b888d/dms3rep/multi/NP.jpg\"/>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            An exciting opportunity has become available for our extended W\u0101nanga community at\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"/ng\u0101-purapura\">\r\n      \n           Ng\u0101 Purapura\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           . Ng\u0101 Purapura is a world-class training facility and is seeking a Pouora to join the team. The primary role is to ensure that our clients and manuhiri receive the utmost ultimate quality and personalised experience.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Applications are now being sought to fulfill this busy, dynamic role.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           The ideal candidate for this role has:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Outstanding customer service &amp; sales skills,\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Communicates well in Te Reo M\u0101ori and English,\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Good administration and computer skills,\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            The ability to work well within a team and multi task,\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            An eye for detail,\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Experience in the fitness industry preferred, however training will be given.\n            \r\n        <span>\r\n          \n             \ufeff\n            \r\n        </span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           For further information or to apply for this role contact:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Dionne Seng, Kaihaut\u016b Te Whare Tiaki Rawa\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            E.\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"mailto:Dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           Dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           P. 06 3649011 xtn 757\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Visit our\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"https://website.yorb.tech/job-vacancies\">\r\n      \n           Job Vacancy\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0section to view all jobs and employee benefits.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
